FORMAT: 1A
HOST: http://127.0.0.1:5000

# Book Management API
API quản lý sách cho phép lấy thông tin sách, lấy sách theo ID, thêm sách mới, cập nhật và xóa sách.

# Group Books

## Books Collection [/books]

### Lấy danh sách tất cả sách [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Attributes (array[Book])

---

### Thêm sách mới [POST]

+ Request (application/json)
    + Attributes (BookInput)

+ Response 201

+ Response 400 (application/json)
    + Attributes (Error)

---

## Book [/books/{id}]

+ Parameters
    + id: 1 (number, required) - ID của sách

---

### Lấy thông tin sách theo ID [GET]

+ Response 200 (application/json)
    + Attributes (Book)

+ Response 404 (application/json)
    + Attributes (Error)

---

### Cập nhật thông tin sách theo ID [PUT]

+ Request (application/json)
    + Attributes (BookInput)

+ Response 200

+ Response 400 (application/json)
    + Attributes (Error)

+ Response 404 (application/json)
    + Attributes (Error)

---

### Xóa sách theo ID [DELETE]

+ Response 204 (application/json)
    + Attributes
        + success: true (boolean)
        + message: Xóa thành công (string)

+ Response 404 (application/json)
    + Attributes (Error)

---

# Data Structures

## Book (object)
+ id: 1 (number)
+ title: Clean Code (string)
+ author: Robert Martin (string)
+ status: available (enum[string])
    + Members
        + available
        + borrowed

---

## BookInput (object)
+ title: Clean Code (string, required)
+ author: Robert Martin (string, required)
+ status: available (enum[string], required)
    + Members
        + available
        + borrowed

---

## Error (object)
+ success: false (boolean)
+ message: Đã xảy ra lỗi (string)
+ errors (array[string])
    + title không được để trống
    + isbn không hợp lệ